	<item>
		<title>By: Jack Fitsgerald</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/buzzfeed-madonna-definitive-1-pop-diva/20141009#comment-4505</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jack Fitsgerald]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2014 00:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=2160#comment-4505</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Doesnt matter what we or anyone else thinks, she won her Queen of Pop title through hard graft and was elevated to that title by us, the paying public! And thats the way it should be! Not like Michael Jackson and his self proclaimed title, Madonna has never referenced herself as a Queen, ever! But the public knows, they know who inspired all the others, who blazed a trail before Kylie or GaGa even got record deals! They also know that officially, on a global scale, she is the biggest selling, most awarded and most succesful chart female of all time. There truly is only 1 Queen, and that is Madonna, the end!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Doesnt matter what we or anyone else thinks, she won her Queen of Pop title through hard graft and was elevated to that title by us, the paying public! And thats the way it should be! Not like Michael Jackson and his self proclaimed title, Madonna has never referenced herself as a Queen, ever! But the public knows, they know who inspired all the others, who blazed a trail before Kylie or GaGa even got record deals! They also know that officially, on a global scale, she is the biggest selling, most awarded and most succesful chart female of all time. There truly is only 1 Queen, and that is Madonna, the end!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
